    " La estructura de la semana se ve bien; cambia ejercicios, rangos o el split para renovar el estimulo." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " The week's structure looks good; change exercises, rep ranges or the split to refresh the stimulus."
          }
        },
