    "Fase asociada con la consolidación de la memoria emocional y procedimental. Se concentra en la segunda mitad de la noche; acortar ese periodo puede reducir el tiempo REM de forma desproporcionada." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A stage associated with consolidating emotional and procedural memory. It's concentrated in the second half of the night; cutting that period short can reduce REM time disproportionately."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
